0aa2fba4-3a09-4ddc-a3aa-f7ab35004468	4ddaeb3e-1d1c-4382-8daf-9473fbe4a293	12	TEXT	MEMEVAL_conv_226_v8.docx > Gia Cát Lượng có tước hiệu gì?	Vị quân sư của nhà Thục có tước hiệu gì? Gia Cát Lượng có tước hiệu gì? Ông khi còn sống có tước hiệu '''Vũ hương hầu''' (武乡侯), sau khi mất có thụy hiệu là Trung Vũ hầu, do đó hậu thế thường hay gọi ông là '''Vũ hầu''' (武侯) hay '''Gia Cát Vũ hầu''' (诸葛武侯) để tỏ lòng tôn kính.	\N	Gia Cát Lượng khi còn sống mang tước hiệu Vũ hương hầu (武乡侯), sau khi mất được thụy hiệu Trung Vũ hầu và thường được gọi là Vũ hầu hoặc Gia Cát Vũ hầu.	{"Gia Cát Lượng","tước hiệu","Vũ hương hầu","Trung Vũ hầu","Vũ hầu","Gia Cát Vũ hầu"}	{"Gia Cát Lượng có tước hiệu gì khi còn sống?","Sau khi mất, Gia Cát Lượng được thụy hiệu là gì?","Người ta thường gọi Gia Cát Lượng bằng danh xưng nào?","Vũ hương hầu và Trung Vũ hầu là những danh hiệu nào của Gia Cát Lượng?","Có phải Gia Cát Lượng còn được gọi là Gia Cát Vũ hầu không?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[-0.05586903,0.03418706,-0.012748032,-0.015047584,-0.052887768,0.034128733,-0.016212592,-0.015405775,0.020012937,-0.015409503,0.00080871856,0.01624799,0.0096858265,-0.058133237,0.066898815,-0.020206306,0.018295253,-0.0044392813,0.043910705,0.052732967,-0.04087013,-0.020654287,0.021888468,-0.062095296,0.017217482,0.006182317,0.055524595,0.01300362,0.004647486,-0.039629616,0.0027792964,-0.00825674,0.0059781396,0.007010875,-0.036410775,-0.1105568,0.021627113,0.012450396,-0.027241848,0.007340507,0.042425107,0.047109168,-0.013502443,0.03527886,0.0047229184,0.0032516972,0.015551666,0.01000332,0.00024727746,-0.023919605,0.014032609,-0.042734113,-0.021714205,0.018109608,-0.06073546,0.021206224,0.0183026,-0.021225026,-0.06398412,-0.04990954,-0.021580713,-0.0009411904,0.037972827,-0.033709675,0.00019803956,-0.056186642,0.0032065625,-0.0446046,0.038616408,0.06707471,0.014088241,-0.07537194,0.009595833,-0.0279107,0.021393023,0.008915981,-0.03169608,-0.01846733,-0.021932038,0.106679864,0.014015195,0.032027807,0.010200956,-0.010726656,0.0