54825e52-fd99-49fa-adbe-aed105acdc7a	64dab009-ee89-41f7-895a-d5ad96cc38b4	3	TEXT	MEMEVAL_conv_99_v10.docx > Haile Selassie đã làm gì trong chiến tranh Italo - Abyssinian lần thứ hai?	Haile Selassie đã làm gì trong chiến tranh Italo - Abyssinian lần thứ hai? Haile Selassie đã làm gì trong chiến tranh Italo - Abyssinian lần thứ hai? Haile Selassie đã kêu gọi Liên Hợp Quốc hỗ trợ vào năm 1935.	\N	Trong cuộc chiến Italo‑Abyssinian lần thứ hai, Hoàng đế Haile Selassie đã kêu gọi sự hỗ trợ của Liên Hợp Quốc vào năm 1935.	{"Haile Selassie","Chiến tranh Italo‑Abyssinian lần thứ hai","kêu gọi hỗ trợ","Liên Hợp Quốc","năm 1935"}	{"Haile Selassie đã làm gì trong cuộc chiến Italo‑Abyssinian lần thứ hai?","Ông đã yêu cầu sự giúp đỡ từ tổ chức nào vào năm 1935?","Liên Hợp Quốc có tham gia hỗ trợ Ethiopia trong cuộc chiến này không?","Mốc thời gian quan trọng của hành động kêu gọi hỗ trợ là khi nào?","Mục đích của lời kêu gọi của Haile Selassie là gì?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[-0.03159606,-0.072733015,0.024327006,-0.020838765,0.02559011,-0.0471787,0.10459847,0.008009807,0.003457259,-0.01869257,-0.04699037,-0.016993964,0.03018901,-0.03278174,0.055097573,-0.04023275,-0.12988274,-0.0055721155,0.04685309,-0.005592127,-0.0035424908,0.012599705,-0.0049505862,-0.033171896,0.017431563,0.032452602,0.014803975,0.020232046,-0.022165386,0.035095494,0.018162284,0.07818673,0.065100305,0.032769408,-0.035015058,-0.004582509,0.09148225,-0.004359471,-0.027921574,-0.008750094,0.08062683,0.04002009,0.0031320504,-0.030442633,0.026252035,0.03291671,-0.040534068,-0.038020696,-0.036355417,0.041340087,0.030067572,0.0212963,0.02460866,-0.0024666796,0.032360964,-0.075985216,0.00482029,-0.073749386,-0.041424505,0.0067146155,-0.00086563046,-0.035003517,-0.037650816,-0.052460194,-0.015797848,0.026588611,0.015919244,-0.008353106,0.008379651,-0.038714185,0.05842354,-0.07527394,0.07325568,0.006962069,0.0004936211,0.0034554359,-0.00029407573,0.100205824,0.042191807,-0.055956975,-0.0053205285,-0.046344884,0.011107388,0.015908