3a0ecbc0-df44-414b-a474-72c85367b3a0	552c0bc4-fa1c-4e1f-9b70-83b81ccb0f8e	6	TEXT	MEMEVAL_conv_85_v8.docx > Hán Vũ Đế đã đối xử thế nào với các tướng bại trận như Lý Lăng?	Hán Vũ Đế đã đối xử thế nào với các tướng bại trận như Lý Lăng? Hán Vũ Đế đã đối xử thế nào với các tướng bại trận như Lý Lăng? Hán Vũ Đế không tha thứ cho những viên tướng bại trận, không xét hoàn cảnh và tình thế của họ, thẳng tay trừng trị. Vì vậy, nhiều tướng bại trận phải theo hàng giặc chứ không dám về triều đình.	\N	Han Wu Emperor strictly punished traitorous generals such as Li Lang without forgiveness, leading many to remain with the enemy.	{"Han Wu Emperor","traitorous generals","Li Lang","no forgiveness","harsh punishment",defection,"enemy alignment"}	{"What happens to a general who defects or is considered a traitor?","Is there any possibility of pardon for a traitorous officer?","Will a commander who collaborates with the enemy be punished severely?","How does the policy treat leaders who betray the state?","Are there any circumstances that could mitigate punishment for defectors?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[-0.05240107,0.05480292,0.0044442913,-0.041604236,-0.012654088,-0.042578306,0.042327333,0.010604638,0.04685464,-0.054498613,-0.019972418,-0.004550386,0.0026073002,-0.078418635,0.12176301,-0.016877316,0.031294852,-0.020730002,0.063548215,0.011601992,-0.10748473,-0.017187528,0.03494989,0.049585886,-0.015378343,0.0075567765,0.05314737,-0.0014320617,-0.0018774268,-0.035603866,-0.008342554,-0.0053304383,0.030348169,0.014987837,-0.11605057,-0.0698671,0.071677,0.0021120934,-0.04543019,0.0012948244,0.015686013,0.0021905098,-0.025509689,0.047095392,-0.022390746,-0.034162104,0.038519025,-0.01606075,-0.003150817,0.010696144,0.0015434348,-0.008950512,0.012832001,0.049594533,-0.024318561,-0.03406961,-0.0051815477,-0.021430677,-0.03523034,-0.037663553,-0.040543694,0.017862728,0.017341796,-0.077443786,-0.015245503,-0.07386367,-0.020674042,-0.025345204,-0.00530428,0.024583116,0.0129341,-0.08506186,-0.0017572112