2f8098af-bbdf-474a-b958-c55088517877	5623b3b6-a034-4089-a865-3fed635298a1	6	TEXT	MEMEVAL_conv_97_v8.docx > Điều gì làm cho Sao Hải Vương này có màu xanh lam?	Điều gì làm cho hành tinh này có màu xanh lam? Điều gì làm cho Sao Hải Vương này có màu xanh lam? Khí methan trong tầng ngoài khí quyển là nguyên nhân khiến Sao Hải Vương hiện lên với màu xanh lam.	\N	Màu xanh lam của Sao Hải Vương/điểm hành tinh do khí methane trong tầng ngoài khí quyển gây ra.	{methane,"tầng ngoài khí quyển","màu xanh lam","Sao Hải Vương","hành tinh","nguyên nhân màu sắc"}	{"Tại sao Sao Hải Vương lại có màu xanh lam?","Khí methane ảnh hưởng như thế nào đến màu sắc của hành tinh?","Có phải tất cả các hành tinh có methane đều màu xanh?","Màu xanh lam của Sao Hải Vương có thay đổi theo thời gian không?","Làm sao để xác định thành phần khí quyển gây ra màu xanh lam?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[-0.01486333,-0.06156971,0.041016202,-0.026521973,-0.015503131,-0.0460437,0.064292766,-0.006325717,0.042248085,-0.022010876,0.07331946,-0.0022513575,-0.010237637,-0.00028584615,0.08320768,0.016105574,-0.017372994,-0.04155637,0.046286907,-0.042324554,-0.027721161,0.015203563,-0.048645414,-0.06921278,0.123706,-0.002908581,-0.069186434,0.023740185,-0.003428009,0.003023572,-0.0036496192,-0.027063454,0.034101643,-0.005788492,-0.08213476,-0.07498496,0.0462207,-0.021639587,-0.10893389,0.0007663063,-0.01015993,0.013256944,-0.016792802,-0.020062929,0.07743478,0.008404476,0.028464606,0.042172093,-0.029152103,0.015358251,-0.05135583,-0.026463829,-0.008770946,0.0065320586,0.00060974923,-0.04841876,-0.00380686,-0.025043897,-0.054398667,-0.023362508,-0.041429233,-0.009123727,0.01293831,-0.032196946,-0.02097373,-0.04372074,-0.00027894514,0.05342406,0.056071002,0.016375227,0.057076756,-0.099012494,0.087907985,-0.064847276,0.030372566,0.026212167,-0.044287466,-0.025155254,0.022823384,-0.015697077,0.03890315,-0.029481813,0.03822761,-0.0138099175,-0.039626323,0.007542855,-0.020679716,0.039311685,-0.0014298614,0.009154271,-0.024522297,-0.03