0032b1bd-7c0f-4965-a31a-a315fd7f3711	6886bcf8-e9e8-4409-ad6a-df3dcd0354af	67	TEXT	bo-luat-lao-dong-2019.docx > Chương III > Điều 54. Doanh nghiệp cho thuê lại lao động	1. Doanh nghiệp cho thuê lại lao động phải ký quỹ và được cấp Giấy phép hoạt động cho thuê lại lao động.\n\n2. Chính phủ quy định việc ký quỹ, điều kiện, trình tự, thủ tục cấp, cấp lại, gia hạn, thu hồi Giấy phép hoạt động cho thuê lại lao động và danh mục công việc được thực hiện cho thuê lại lao động.	35	Quy định về Doanh nghiệp cho thuê lại lao động: 1. Doanh nghiệp cho thuê lại lao động phải ký quỹ và được cấp Giấy phép hoạt động cho thuê lại lao động.	{III,Doanh,nghiệp,thuê,lại,lao,động,quỹ}	{"Doanh nghiệp cho thuê lại lao động là gì?","Quy định về Doanh nghiệp cho thuê lại lao động như thế nào?","Nội dung chi tiết của Doanh nghiệp cho thuê lại lao động gồm những gì?","Nội dung theo Điều 54. Doanh nghiệp cho thuê lại lao động được áp dụng ra sao?"}	{ALL}	{ALL}	[-0.0008229201,-0.051761925,0.045426764,-0.025834579,-0.010225772,0.028274657,0.046313554,-0.0430128,-0.012909201,-0.0055331807,-0.0007673652,-0.030490017,0.01144571,-0.06533248,-0.01506627,0.044812787,-0.02794383,0.01319794,0.023247646,0.0342416,-0.019429248,0.0016583841,-0.030883173,-0.037781753,-0.029988902,0.04705169,0.00077464216,0.016595904,-0.057493016,0.0800636,0.005506929,-0.0029886828,0.02395715,0.009552514,-0.035909794,-0.00595195,-0.04317365,0.032686934,-0.02421779,0.00021495289,0.02709945,-0.026824357,0.007162428,-0.031498335,-0.011813103,-0.03451433,-0.06801114,0.0065126787,0.0061404416,-0.020629648,0.0081640715,0.026750822,-0.049437277,-0.028425487,0.05283886,0.0056447065,0.027618136,-0.0027741806,0.025145397,-0.04888293,0.040309258,-0.047037616,-0.009059708,0.046277955,0.030146409,-0.063643396,-0.015196358,0.06538123,-0.024017047,-0.062653884,0.015085863,-0.023071675,-0.027144166,-0.10051033,-5.4278047e-05,0.035773143,-0.0037674045,0.035623398,0.005921721,-0.06493058,0.058064044,-0.08910095,0.07689954,0.0043730466,0.00717654