,0.03206951,0.025214065,-0.030203678,0.03573667,-0.008764334,-0.030825092,-0.05767181,-0.012166467,0.033715636,0.006805869,0.00070757914,0.05714959,0.022803098,0.003761224,-0.035736725,-0.0029816672,-0.05525329,0.02154334,0.01120687,0.015220622,-0.010303637,0.0011648188,-0.016259564,0.025243316,2.7646909e-05,-0.061161887,-0.004604998,-0.016218394,-0.07233451,-0.021278726,0.02181976,-0.040684734,-0.0054396754,0.014416959,-0.005961239,-0.032061737,0.022865947,0.034621254,0.056383695,0.05272499,-0.041418184,-0.039775632,0.010525433,-0.028610177,0.038365316,-0.014049452,-0.01090726,0.012200496,0.066561066,0.00063459185,-0.010260044,0.070435435,-0.012736669,0.037288696,0.01928691,0.055587597,-0.02982018,-0.0250267,-0.02455949,-0.013895188,-0.047462583,-0.016184267,-0.0016135769,-0.018228017,-0.025775727,-0.01139981,-0.042356055,-0.00357522,0.015285312,0.047790892,0.0067847874,0.021024415,-0.0076687722,0.0031729229,0.016762316,0.11556621,-0.007515532,-0.023981841,0.0136439465,-0.010062023,-0.029845992,0.0434434,-0.026727315,0.00519916,-0.057311554,-0.0126351975,-0.00077218853,-0.04301431,-0.033900153,0.003346257,-0.036012948,0.0242778,0.024565779,0.010756208,0.01066904,0.013126188,-0.00038490098,-0.05186053,0.0029022717,-0.028149253,0.022799004,0.018201511,-0.032780062,-0.042320687,-0.0054505756,0.065275535,0.012992364,0.0080435295,0.014327935,0.0017372128,-0.018616505,0.02586187,0.04293171,-0.0019732947,0.007535222,-0.025071936,-0.011434343,0.032144606,0.019772304,0.0020496598,-0.0061342428,0.049433526,0.0043297806,0.05400293,0.0135489805,-0.046041857,0.035872176,-0.05804722,0.025525868]	**Câu trả lời:**  \n- **Sao Thiên Vương (Neptune) cũng có màu sắc tương tự như Sao Hải Vương (Uranus).**  \n- Nguyên nhân chính là **methan (CH₄) trong tầng trên của khí quyển**, giống như ở Sao Hải Vương, khiến ánh sáng đỏ bị hấp thụ và ánh sáng xanh‑lam được phản xạ, tạo nên màu xanh lam đặc trưng.  \n- Ngoài thành phần methane, **hai hành tinh này còn có thành phần hoá học tương tự** (nước, amonia và các hợp chất dễ bay hơi), nên chúng chia sẻ nhiều đặc điểm vật lý‑hóa học.  \n- **Sao Thiên Vương có bầu khí quyển lạnh nhất trong hệ Mặt Trời**, với nhiệt độ tối thiểu khoảng **49 K (‑224 °C)**, nhưng điều này không ảnh hưởng đến màu xanh lam mà chỉ làm cho khí quyển trở nên rất lạnh.\n\n**Tóm tắt các điều khoản đã dùng:**  \n- *Tài liệu 1*: “Sao Thiên Vương cũng chứa methan trong khí quyển, nhưng có bầu khí quyển lạnh nhất… nhiệt độ cực tiểu 49 K (‑224 °C).”  \n- *Tài liệu 2*: “Sao Hải Vương và Sao Thiên Vương có thành phần hoá học tương tự nhau, chứa nhiều hợp chất dễ bay hơi như nước, amonia và methan.”  \n- *Tài liệu 3*: “Khí methan trong tầng ngoài khí quyển là nguyên nhân khiến Sao Hải Vương hiện lên với màu xanh lam.”  \n\nNhư vậy, **Sao Thiên Vương cũng có màu xanh lam do methane**, tương tự như Sao Hải Vương.	[{"file_url": "/api/ai/documents/5623b3b6-a034-4089-a865-3fed635298a1/download", "breadcrumb": "MEMEVAL_conv_97_v8.docx > Còn Sao Thiên Vương thì sao, nó có màu xanh lam?", "chunk_type": "TEXT", "page_number": null, "document_name": "MEMEVAL_conv_97_v8.docx", "relevance_score": 0.9794}, {"file_url": "/api/ai/documents/5623b3b6-a034-4089-a865-3fed635298a1/download", "breadcrumb": "MEMEVAL_conv_97_v8.docx > Hai hành tinh Hải Vương và Thiên Vương này có điểm gì chung về thành phần?", "chunk_type": "TEXT", "page_number": null, "document_name": "MEMEVAL_conv_97_v8.docx", "relevance_score": 0.0349}, {"file_url": "/api/ai/documents/5623b3b6-a034-4089-a865-3fed635298a1/download", "breadcrumb": "MEMEVAL_conv_97_v8.docx > Điều gì làm cho Sao Hải Vương này có màu xanh lam?", "chunk_type": "TEXT", "page_number": null, "document_name": "MEMEVAL_conv_97_v8.docx", "relevance_score": 0.0142}]	{ALL}	{ALL}	1	2026-09-30 14:13:26.911604+07	2026-09-30 14:13:26.911604+07
